\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\taxon{Remark}
\title{Open model-instance questions}
\tag{ftip}
\p{The relative capability and cost of KDA, full attention, and JEPA
candidates remain empirical questions. A reproducible comparison requires
identified checkpoints or reproducible training, fixed evaluation seeds, and
measured cost vectors. Architecture-specific ceilings remain estimands and
hypotheses rather than established constants.}
